# ThalosPrimeLibrary.v2
Modern AI generates fluent answers but lacks verifiable origin, stability, and resistance to scrutiny—creating a gap between language and true knowledge. TPL.v2 fixes this by enforcing structured stages for retrieval, reasoning, validation, and presentation, producing fully traceable, auditable, and provable outputs.
